WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:50.480
THE HERO LOST IN THE GLACIER

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.320
I...

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:57.070
will take care of him.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:00.780
Let's finish him this time!

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.080
Oh, of course.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.080
Hadlar already took care of the Hero.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:11.000
He may be a downgrade, but I would lose
face if I didn't kill a Disciple of Avan.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.880
Why you...!

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:17.220
Bring it on!
I'll fight to the end alone if I have to!

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:22.510
That's right.
You have to avenge Dai, don't you?

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:27.140
He died trying to rescue you after all.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.730
<i>That's right!
Dai was defeated because of me!</i>

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.650
<i>Because of my recklessness!</i>

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:41.910
<i>If I lose my head and get killed fighting,
who's going to rescue Dai?!</i>

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.280
<i>Remember...</i>

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:49.750
<i>a Mage must always be
the most level-headed in the party.</i>

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:53.040
<i>Mentor!</i>

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:56.880
<i>How do I use what little
Magic Power I have left?!</i>

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:01.260
<i>The one thing I can do
for Dai right now is...</i>

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:06.060
Come on now, little Mage.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:08.600
Hey!

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.690
<i>All I can do is run as far as I can...</i>

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.020
<i>and let everyone know what happened!</i>

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.360
A wise choice.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:21.070
He kept his cool
even after I provoked him.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.540
Dammit!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.300
Got you!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.390
Big Guy!

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:57.150
That's right. There was another
from the Hero's party who could fly.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:58.980
The Beast King's here!

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.190
Are you my opponent now?

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.660
Beast King Redemption Blast!

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:15.080
You're kidding.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:21.170
The brave Beast King Crocodine
just up and ran away.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:26.180
I've never let a target
escape me twice before.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.810
That boy is beginning to irritate me.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.730
Big Guy...

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:38.770
Are you okay?

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:41.150
I...

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.820
I...

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.910
I didn't want to abandon Dai and run.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:50.330
But... there was nothing else I could do!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.830
I didn't have a choice!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:55.250
I know.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:04.380
You'd never choose to turn tail
unless the situation was severe.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:09.470
That's why I ran without hesitation.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.100
I know the sort of man you are.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:23.360
Let's go back to Papnica.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:46.800
Is it done?

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.510
No. I doubt he's unharmed,

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:54.850
but my Ultra Combustion Slash
didn't find its mark.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:06:00.610
In that instant, Dai focused
all his remaining power into an attack,

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:05.280
which defended himself
by countering my Combustion Slash.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:09.990
What combat instincts!
What an unyielding will to fight!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:17.080
That must be the millennia of battles
etched in the blood of the Dragon Knights.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:21.330
<i>And the attack he used
in that instant was...</i>

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.130
<i>Gigabreak!</i>

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.420
<i>The spell was Zapple
and its power was weak...</i>

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.760
<i>but that was definitely the attack of
his father, General Baran!</i>

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.520
He may say he rejects his father,

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:42.560
but it appears that the shadow of Baran
is a great influence on Dai.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.530
Like father like son.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.110
Don't die yet, Dai!

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:54.450
Otherwise, I'd have to question
why I bothered becoming a monster!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.660
You idiot! You stupid fool!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.250
-Stop it, Chiu!
-Come here!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.500
Come here, you idiot!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:11.340
You know, I was actually beginning
to think you weren't that bad!

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:15.510
And then you went off
and put Dai in danger!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.180
You call yourself a friend of the Hero?!

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:21.020
I-I'm sorry, Chiu.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.520
Everyone...

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.690
There's no excusing what I did.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.820
It's all my fault.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.320
Apologizing won't fix anything!

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:36.280
-Chiu, was it?
-Huh?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.240
Try to forgive him.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:39.910
Hyunckel?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:44.170
He's just a fledgling. It's not his fault.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.750
He's got enough on his plate
saving his own hide.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:54.010
Go get yourself patched up
and get some rest.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:57.260
Hey! D-Don't say that!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:02.350
I'd rather take a fist to the face
than sympathy from you!

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.730
Crocodine, you'll have to search for Dai.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.480
Right. Got it.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:08.440
Hey!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:13.070
Dai probably fell in the ocean
in the far north, northwest of Orzam.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.200
Please hurry.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.280
Hey!

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.910
Dai's no normal human. I doubt he's dead.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.870
Hey, rat.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:25.960
I've got room for someone your size.
Care to come?

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.460
Of course!
How wise of you to bring me along!

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.130
W-Wait! Let me come with you!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.840
This isn't for the wounded or children!

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:36.850
Hey!

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:38.810
Dammit!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.850
You can't search if you can't fly.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:45.270
I doubt you have
the Magic Power for that right now.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.400
Are you kidding me?!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:51.320
Dai's lost because of me!
I can't leave this to someone else!

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:54.240
P-Princess, please!
You've got to do something!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:58.740
Have you got a spell or something
that can heal Magic Power?!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.330
I've never heard of a spell like that.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:02.540
Oh, but...

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:08.380
Didn't I give the Papnica Troika some
Magic Water that heals Magic Power?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:12.010
Yes. I believe Marin has it.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.470
That's it!

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.140
And now he's all fired up.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:20.390
You talked to him like that
on purpose, didn't you?

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:25.190
I figured it'd be more effective
than yelling at him.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:29.150
Healing from wounds
caused by Dark Aura takes time.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:33.530
I can't have him being morose
while I'm stuck in bed.

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.910
I need him on his feet.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:43.620
Hmm. Sometimes it's hard to tell
if you guys rely on Popp or not.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.210
-Please!
-Stop!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.500
-I'm begging you, Miss Marin!
-Fine! You can have some!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.170
-I'm begging you!
-Okay, now let go!

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.750
-You've got to!
- I said yes, so let go!

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:53.420
Huh?!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.890
Here he comes.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:09.230
I bet he's worried
that I'm going to outshine him.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:17.450
<i>Hold on, Dai!
I promise I'm going to rescue you!</i>

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.700
<i>What did you just say, Hyunckel?!</i>

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:28.160
I said once Dai's safety is confirmed,
we should invade the Dark Army stronghold.

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.420
But...

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:33.170
Sovereign Rock Castle, the enemy's
first line of defense has fallen.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.590
The only remaining
pillars of the Dark Army

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:39.800
are Hadlar, Mystvearn, and Killvearn.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.930
Our fight with
Dark King Vearn is drawing near.

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.520
BEAST KING REDEMPTION BLAST

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.530
ULTRA COMBUSTION SLASH

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:56.940
Right here.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:01.530
We can assume that Dark King Vearn
is in the Field of Death.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:04.990
Everyone, what is our course of action?

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:11.500
I agree with the Disciples of Avan.
We should invade the Field of Death.

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.500
Can we defeat them in an invasion?

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.510
We doubt we can defeat them all.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.180
But if we can take even one of them down,

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:25.680
it will bring us that much closer
to Dark King Vearn.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.390
Very well then.

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:34.610
Now it's time to unite all of the world!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.900
Come on, my fellow world leaders!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:39.530
Yes.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:42.780
King Bengarna, do you object?

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:45.700
No. I have no objections.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:49.540
It's just, I believe
we'd need that boy for this.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.330
You mean Dai?

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.500
That's right.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:55.750
I've been focused on weapons and arms,

00:11:55.920 --> 00:12:00.920
<i>but when I saw him save us,
I was honestly in awe.</i>

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.300
Heroes truly are powerful.

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:07.310
My heart was pounding the whole time.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:12.850
You were worked up
like a child back there.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:20.570
Princess Leona, if he is successfully
rescued, I promise to help however I can.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.360
I know they'll find him.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:26.910
Dai's friends are searching the icy seas
from the sky as we speak.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:30.620
But, isn't that close
to the enemy stronghold?

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.460
If memory serves,

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.880
the Field of Death
is a place that even birds avoid.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:41.130
Perhaps it's because of
the Dark King's power.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:46.090
<i>Please be okay, Dai!</i>

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:50.220
Dai, I'm going to find you!

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:54.560
This might take a while.

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:59.730
So it's time to face King Vearn.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:05.320
Mystvearn, I never confirmed Dai's death.

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:09.740
In fact, I'm almost certain he's alive.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:14.960
I haven't wiped out
the Hero and his friends as ordered.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:18.040
I've failed my promise to King Vearn.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:23.090
It's possible
I'll be executed on the spot.

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.010
That's why I'll say it now.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:31.350
I used to shun you
for your mysterious nature,

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.680
but now I'm grateful to you.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:38.860
Of all the six Legion Commanders,
it's possible that

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.690
you were the most sincere with me.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:46.200
Underneath that mask of silence you wear,

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:49.530
I can't help but sense a fiery soul.

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:51.120
Hadlar...

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:55.200
I can now face my end with my head high.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.170
Thank you.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.750
Oh, don't be such a worrywart.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:07.800
You've powered up greatly,
just like King Vearn expected.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:12.720
It'll be anticlimactic,
but he'll commend you and that'll be it.

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:14.850
<i>He'll commend us?</i>

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:19.440
<i>Well, this was all thanks
to my research after all.</i>

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.190
Huh?! What about me?!

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:30.070
King Vearn, I, Hadlar, have arrived.

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:46.710
-Oh!
-Can it be?!

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:50.260
At ease, you two.

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:55.010
My heart feels bright and clear.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:15:01.230
Like the sun shining through
the clouds above.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:07.150
My face has never been seen
by anyone but you two.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:11.280
But, I believe revealing it to Hadlar

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:15.450
is the best way
to express my approval of him.

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.040
What's wrong?

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:23.880
Does this ancient,
haggard face surprise you?

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.750
Are you...?!

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.210
Indeed.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:29.420
I am Vearn.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:36.890
Dark King... Vearn.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:37.890
VEARN, THE DARK KING

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:54.200
<i>Is this truly the King Vearn
that I've feared for so long?!</i>

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.740
<i>I sense the pressure from him.</i>

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:02.420
<i>There's no mistaking that immense presence
I feel through that thin veil.</i>

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:06.000
<i>But he's so incredibly old!</i>

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:10.590
<i>Does he really possess the power
of a god of the Underworld?</i>

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.930
<i>That frail neck...</i>

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:18.760
<i>As a Superior Being,
I could snap it so easily!</i>

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:21.350
Care to try, Hadlar?

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.230
My King, forgive me!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.270
Fear not.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:33.990
That's what I've always liked about you.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:40.080
That boundless spirit,
and heart that believes only in power.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:44.670
Your recent behavior
had been rather uncharacteristic of you.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:50.170
Seeing that spirit rekindled within you
puts me at ease.

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.630
<i>I can never beat him.</i>

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:56.760
<i>He is truly worlds beyond me.</i>

00:16:56.930 --> 00:17:00.510
As I had hoped,
you have broken through your shell.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:06.650
Your power is now
almost in league with my own.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:10.070
I hereby rescind my previous order.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:17.490
I would like you to continue your duties
as Dark Commander by my side.

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:20.120
If I may speak, my Dark King.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:25.830
It pains me to say this
after you have granted me such mercy...

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:32.380
but there is something I wish to do
before being reinstated as Dark Commander.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:35.130
Is this about the Hero?

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.090
Yes.

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:41.310
By any means, I wish to defeat
Dai and the other Disciples of Avan!

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:44.520
That is my final desire!

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:47.440
I beg you grant me this!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:54.400
There is no need for such formalities.

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:58.780
Dai, the Hero, and his allies
are the greatest threat to my army.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:03.290
What objection
would I have to their defeat?

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:07.500
The Six Legions are in shambles.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:12.090
It seems unnecessary
that you command them.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:15.130
Mystvearn, you will take command.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:15.880
Yes, sire.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:19.590
Hadlar, you will protect
the Field of Death.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.010
Surely you won't object to that?

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.100
If Dai survived,

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:28.520
then they will surely
come to attack this place.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.980
To take my head.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.070
Indeed. I shall obey, my King.

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.320
And what should I be doing?

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:40.160
You will maintain your current role.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:41.780
Very good, sire.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:46.450
I suppose I'll continue
my morbid work for now.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.120
Why?!

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:52.170
Why haven't they mentioned me?!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:57.380
My Mystic Legion and I
are still in fighting shape!

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:01.840
They're acting like
I don't even matter anymore!

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:09.560
What did I suck up to Hadlar and
the other Legion Commanders for?!

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:14.860
I have to distinguish myself
to make Dark King Vearn acknowledge me!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:17.440
And for that...

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.700
<i>What... happened to me?</i>

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.750
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.420
<i>In the ice?</i>

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.500
<i>I can't move.</i>

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.090
<i>My wounds haven't healed.</i>

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:41.380
<i>How did I survive like this?</i>

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:49.310
<i>I see. You protected me.</i>

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.270
<i>It's warm.</i>

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.270
<i>You kept me from being frozen in ice.</i>

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:58.940
<i>A crack!</i>

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:02.200
<i>Did Hadlar's attack cause that?</i>

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:03.320
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:04.950
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:08.240
<i>You sustained such damage for me.</i>

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:12.160
<i>And you've been protecting me
all this time.</i>

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.670
<i>I have to get out of here!</i>

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:24.340
Tell me, would you like
some more servants?

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:25.510
Sire?

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:29.430
The game of chess is quite deep.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:33.270
It's thought to be a game of humans,

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:37.480
but it was originally
invented by the gods.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:39.980
<i>The beauty of chess</i>

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:45.910
<i>is in using the five types of pieces with
different abilities to protect the king.</i>

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:50.200
<i>The pawn moves forward
to defeat its enemies.</i>

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:55.370
<i>The knight leaps eight ways,
striking from above.</i>

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:02.420
<i>The rook charges horizontally or
vertically to decimate foes.</i>

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:08.220
<i>The bishop glides diagonally
like a phantom.</i>

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:12.270
And, possessing the abilities
of both rook and bishop,

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.940
the queen is the most powerful piece.

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.520
Th-That shine!

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:21.900
Are those pieces made of...

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:23.740
Orichalcum?!

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.110
Indeed.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.410
Very observant of you.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:32.700
You can have those five pieces.

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:36.420
I haven't had anyone to play with
in a long time anyways.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.790
If you use the Forbidden Magic
you used to create Flazzard,

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:45.670
and make those pieces the ultimate force
that would serve with you as their king...

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.470
wouldn't that make things interesting?

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:56.390
It's around here! I'm sure of it!

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:59.270
Dai's somewhere around here!

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:07.360
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:07.360
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:11.330
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:11.330
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:15.410
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:15.410
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:19.460
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:19.460
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:22.750
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:22.750
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:26.670
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:26.670
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:30.390
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:30.390
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:34.680
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:34.680
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:38.730
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:38.730
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:42.520
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:42.520
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:48.110
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:48.110
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:53.700
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:53.700
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:57.500
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:57.500
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:03.960
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:03.960
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:08.470
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:08.470
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:11.640
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:11.640
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:16.310
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:16.310
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:22.520
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:22.520
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.330
<i>Popp's party wanders
the freezing ocean in search of Dai.</i>

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:40.910
<i>Zaboera appears, seeking
to Kill Dai to earn recognition.</i>

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:43.170
<i>The two sides eventually clash.</i>

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:47.760
<i>Desperate, Zaboera attacks
using a terrifying Super Spell.</i>

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:53.220
<i>As the battle in the glacier intensifies,
a mysterious shining warrior appears.</i>

00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:55.550
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.430
<i>"The Orichalcum Warrior"</i>

00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:59.600
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
